# Portfolio assistant — every key is optional and server-side only.
# With no keys the assistant still works, answering from the portfolio's own
# data. Each key adds a free AI provider; they are tried in this order and the
# assistant falls back to local answers when one runs out of quota.
# Copy to .env for local development; set the same names in Vercel for production.

# Gemini — create the key at https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey in a Google
# Cloud project WITHOUT billing enabled: it can then never be charged.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-flash-lite-latest

# Groq — https://console.groq.com/keys (free tier, no card needed).
GROQ_API_KEY=
# GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.1-8b-instant
